The FreeInkBook container, XML and entity parser and FreeInkFont arena are
vendored. XmlSax uses the ESP32 PSRAM allocator for Expat on the device and
checks the application's BookSource cancellation hook between parse chunks.
The ZIP directory scan uses a temporary arena buffer instead of task stack.
